&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;About THG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="auto"&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast="none"&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at THG Nutrition&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="353" data-end="578"&gt;THG Nutrition is home to some of the world’s most trusted and best-loved wellbeing and nutrition brands, including Myprotein, the world’s largest online sports nutrition brand, alongside Myvegan, Myvitamins and MP Activewear.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start="580" data-end="776"&gt;Our brands and people exist to break boundaries — to power and empower those who want more. We move fast, challenge convention, and back ourselves to win. These values shape how we work every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role: Category Manager | Bars &amp;amp; Snacks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to: Category Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand: Myprotein&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: THG HQ, Manchester (WA15 0AF) - Fully Office Based&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG Nutrition:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;THG Nutrition is home to some of the best loved and most trusted names in wellbeing and nutrition, including Myprotein, the world's largest online sports nutrition brand, and its family of brands, &amp;nbsp;Myvitamins and MP Activewear. Our brands and people exist to break boundaries; to power and empower those who want more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Category Manager, you will be responsible for driving the online commercial success of Bars &amp;amp; Snacks. You will optimise the ecommerce strategy for these categories, ensuring commercial growth and customer engagement across global markets in line with out omni-channel business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Category Performance &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement bars &amp;amp; snacks strategies to maximise online sales, market share, and profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse internal insights (sales data, pricing trends, site metrics) to make data-driven decisions that optimise category performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify category growth opportunities, leveraging global and regional insights to tailor strategies for each market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct frequent site audits to ensure optimal customer experience (CX) and category visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market &amp;amp; Competitor Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor external market trends, including competitor pricing, innovation, and emerging category trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage insights to develop category plans and influence product launches, pricing, and promotional strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Brand &amp;amp; Marketing teams to align product positioning with industry trends and customer demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the internal Retail, Wholesale, Tiktok &amp;amp; Amazon teams to understand insights &amp;amp; omnichannel sales to drive online decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pricing &amp;amp; Promotion Optimisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the pricing strategy for assigned categories, ensuring profitability while remaining competitive in each market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with country managers to optimise pricing across Myprotein sites, balancing growth and margin targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the internal Retail, Wholesale, Tiktok &amp;amp; Amazon teams to balance the calendar plans to drive growth across channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement promotional plans, working with digital marketing teams to drive customer acquisition and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with supply chain &amp;amp; production teams to ensure optimal stock availability across all international warehouses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with procurement, finance &amp;amp; logistics to improve cost efficiencies and bottom-line profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support senior stakeholders in optimising locale &amp;amp; sales channels mix, reducing cost prices, and managing discount strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with customer service teams to address category-specific customer concerns, ensuring a customer-centric approach to category management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Tracking &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain reporting processes to track category performance at a territory level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present insights and strategic recommendations to senior leadership and key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously monitor key performance indicators (KPIs) and adjust strategies accordingly to drive category success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in Ecommerce, Category Management, or Digital Trading, ideally within retail, FMCG, or nutrition/bars &amp;amp; snacks sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to interpret data and translate insights into actionable strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial mindset with experience in pricing, promotion, and margin optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build strong cross-functional relationships and influence stakeholders across marketing, finance, supply chain, and country teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with a strong understanding of customer experience (CX) and ecommerce best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in analytics tools (e.g., BI platforms i.e. Tableau) and ecommerce platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational and communication skills, with the ability to manage multiple priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in excel, SQL &amp;amp; Ai Tools would be desirable as well, but not essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
